/**
 * CinnShift@pzim-devdata — extension.js
 *
 * Graphical front-end for accent color shifting of the active
 * Cinnamon (desktop) and GTK (applications) themes.
 * Self-contained port of the cinnshift.py engine: theme cloning,
 * accent detection, HSV derivative discovery, selector-targeted
 * recoloring and live gsettings reload.
 *
 * The GUI is generated by Cinnamon from settings-schema.json
 * (System Settings -> Extensions -> CinnShift -> gear icon).
 * Toggling "APPLY NOW" executes the shift; the switch resets
 * itself right after execution, so it behaves like a button.
 *
 * Derived themes always reuse the fixed variant suffix
 * "-cinnshift_extension": repeated applications overwrite the same
 * clone instead of multiplying numbered themes, and always rebuild
 * from the ORIGINAL base theme (never from a previous clone), which
 * keeps accent detection stable across successive runs.
 *
 * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
 */

